{"availability":"available","full":"PhyberApex/kuroshiro","name":"kuroshiro","description":"BYOS for TRMNL","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":11,"forks":5,"created":"2025-05-31T19:57:14Z","updated":"2026-10-06T08:42:52Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://kuroshiro-demo.phyberapex.de/","topics":[],"demo":"https://kuroshiro-demo.phyberapex.de/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:18.991Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:18.991Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T09:09:18.991Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:15:58.497Z","stars":11,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-06T09:09:18.991Z","stars":11,"forks":5}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Kuroshiro is an open-source BYOS (Bring Your Own Server) solution for the TRMNL ecosystem. Our goal is to give you more flexibility and control over your TRMNL experience, whether you're self-hosting for fun, learning, or customization. Kuroshiro bundles a NestJS API and a Vue.js UI into a single Docker image, ready to run alongside your own Postgres database.","The :next image has an incomplete admin UI. While the Admin UI rebuild from zero runs, the :next image ships an admin UI that is unfinished and may be broken. Run :latest.","Kuroshiro is for anyone who wants to experiment, self-host, and shape their own TRMNL experience:"],"features":["Self-hosted: Your data, your rules, your server.","All-in-one: API (NestJS) + UI (Vue 3 + Vuetify) bundled together.","Plug & Play: Just add Postgres and go!","Fun to use: Modern, intuitive, and built for tinkerers and pros alike.","Auto Provisioning: Devices set up themselves—like magic!"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/PhyberApex/kuroshiro/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c2d08ccbd5e95e79d86fe685a94df2e502f8d2aa8a8b0aa6b69c9d348fcfe6f9","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:01.319Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T08:11:16.796Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Kuroshiro is an ope